{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The anime school life full of twists and turns is waiting;<i><strong> </strong></i>and in this show\u00a0<strong>you're the main character!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Move to a new town and live the last summer of high school once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You'll meet five charming girls and a whole lot of trouble.<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Get that hot, high school girlfriend you've always wanted!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>If you can...</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394990/extras/4a9da408a307b717c1f1e760b0ed49a2.avif?t=1766416571\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394990/extras_big/4a9da408a307b717c1f1e760b0ed49a2.avif?t=1766416571 width=800 height=565 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;Heart of Summer&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0An old<i>\u00a0&quot;school&quot;</i>\u00a0dating sim, containing everything visual novel fans love, but with a story that uniquely blends multiple genres. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Set in Takagi city in 2000s Japan, the game captures the charm of classic school anime and delivers it in a way never quite seen in a visual novel before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">At times just regular romcom, at times horror, at times... something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Written from the heart with &quot;best of both worlds&quot; as its philosophy, the game\u00a0doesn't take itself too seriously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And that's what the plot is counting on you to think!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURING</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 different GIRLS to DATE\u00a0</strong>\u2014\u00a0<strong>5 different ROUTES to PLAY!<i>\u00a0</i></strong>+ numerous BAD endings!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >School uniforms, miniskirts, loose socks, bloomers, school swimsuits, bikinis, yukatas, maids...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>A true artistic tribute to the <strong>HIGH SCHOOL GIRL AESTHETICA.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>DATE <span class=\"bb_strike\">OR DIE</span>!\u00a0LOVE IS A THRILLER!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394990/extras/a4b2eea82b881397efc06305b01166a1.poster.avif?t=1766416571\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394990/extras/a4b2eea82b881397efc06305b01166a1.webm?t=1766416571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394990/extras/a4b2eea82b881397efc06305b01166a1.mp4?t=1766416571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>WHO KNEW THAT GETTING A GIRLFRIEND INVOLVES...</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...SERIAL KILLERS AND CURSES!?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...THE ITALIAN MAFIA!?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...EMOS!?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...SKATEBOARDING!?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...AN OCCULT SECRET SOCIETY!??</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Your school life is sure to be turbulent with unexpected twists!</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPERIENCE ANIME SCHOOL LIFE IN THE SUMMER!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your clothes wet in the rain during the rainy season!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study (or don't) for exams!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live out your carefree after school life as a real Going-Home-Clubber!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to finish last in the Sports Festival!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the heat during the best summer vacation you'll ever have!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on a SCHOOL TRIP with your class!!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      ...and much more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This summer, it's going to be sunny, hot,  and off the wall!\u00a0 So whatever happens, don't think it'll be that simple: you're about to find out just how serious chasing skirt can be!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394990/extras/2d1d49b24e11d348ce1af9dc4b52aeb2.avif?t=1766416571\" width=595 height=211 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Buyer's insurance: even if you can't get a girlfriend the game studio <strong>\u00a9Akehabara</strong> GUARANTEES to you a free\u2014yes, FREE\u2014best friend from your class.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1394990?t=1766416571","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1394990?t=1766416571","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394990/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766416571","ca